  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Social Cohesion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHS/ADI will build on the AU Year 2024 of ED to organize a series of high level events (lectures, conferences...) focusing on the promotion of the GHA and intercultural dialogue as catalysts for peace, social cohesion and the transformation of African societies. Considering its strategic position, SHS/ADI in collaboration with the AUC, UN Agencies, Universities and other partners will mobilize AU MS through a series of roundtables and addresses to the PRC to raise awareness on the necessity to develop national policies on the promotion of a culture of peace and tolerance to fight xenophobia, hate speech, racism.</narrative>
  </description>
